---
import BaseHead from "../components/BaseHead.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from "../consts";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <Header />
      <p>Hello! I'm a software engineer interested in effective altruism, rationalism, moral philosophy, and meditation. I currently live in Nebraska and work on software to help golf courses manage turfgrass more efficiently.</p>
      <p>I want to do as much as I can to make the future go well. I'm particularly concerned about factory farming, wild animal suffering, and AI safety. I am seeking opportunities to work on these problems directly and am looking to relocate to a major city.</p>
      <p>I'm also a member of <a href="https://www.givingwhatwecan.org/" target="_blank">Giving What We Can</a> and have pledged to donate at least 10% of my income to effective charities. <a href="https://benthams.substack.com/p/a-life-that-cannot-be-a-failure" target="_blank">You should consider doing the same!</a></p>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  .post-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
  }
</style>
